{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the hidden pages of <i>Jurnal Risa</i> comes a visual novel where the boundary between the living and the unseen begins to blur. Step into Jurnal Risa's world where each shadow holds a story, and every whisper leads you deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witness the resurrection of the forspoken nemesis of <i>Jurnal Risa</i> crew that was never told before. Unveil its dark destiny within this horror-adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the tale of Jurnal Risa, as recounted to me by Risa herself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>A Paranormal Adventure Mystery</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Brought to Life with Full Voice Acting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Mini games</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Collect the Fragments of the Past</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to turn the last page and face what lingers beyond?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3417470?t=1749538886","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/7e2034231c01ed4c50ab657e5fe2a2bd5b8e00d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749538886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/bee3580a2c257c32fa43a7904b5128b9014dbce3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749538886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/bee3580a2c257c32fa43a7904b5128b9014dbce3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749538886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3777760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragrap